---
// src/components/FinalCta.astro - Sección de cierre comercial de DECA Light (Tramo 6, v3-premium)
---

<section id="cierre" aria-labelledby="final-cta-heading">
  <div class="w">
    <div class="cta">
      <h2 id="final-cta-heading">
        Tu próxima hora punta, <span>con todos los DeCA listos.</span>
      </h2>
      <p>Pruébalo un mes con tus cargas reales, sin dejar lo que usas hoy.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="b1" href="#demo">Empezar el mes gratis →</a>
        <a class="b2" href="#precios">Ver precios</a>
      </div>
      <div class="chips">
        <span>Primer mes gratis</span>
        <span>Sin tarjeta</span>
        <span>Sin permanencia</span>
        <span>Hecho en Almería</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shot" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="/img/portada.webp"
          alt=""
          aria-hidden="true"
          width="2360"
          height="1600"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #cierre {
    padding: 40px 24px 120px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  .w {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 96px 64px 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, #ECFDF5 0%, #D1FAE5 55%, #A7F3D0 100%);
  }

  .cta h2 {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  .cta h2 span {
    color: #047857;
  }

  .cta p {
    margin: 22px auto 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #065F46;
  }

  .btns {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .b1 {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #047857;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 17px;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -14px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.8);
    transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .b1:hover {
    background: #065F46;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .b2 {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    color: #065F46;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 17px;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
    transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .b2:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .chips {
    margin-top: 26px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 22px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: #065F46;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .chips span {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .chips span::before {
    content: "✓ ";
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #047857;
  }

  .shot {
    position: relative;
    margin: 64px auto 0;
    max-width: 960px;
    height: 300px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
    box-shadow: 0 -1px 0 rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.15), 0 -30px 60px -20px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.35);
  }

  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    #cierre {
      padding: 24px 16px 80px;
    }

    .cta {
      padding: 64px 24px 0;
      border-radius: 28px;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .cta p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .b1,
    .b2 {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .shot {
      height: 160px;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .b1,
    .b2 {
      transition: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
